  "summary": "OpenRath is a PyTorch-like multi-agent, multi-session Python framework whose core runtime objects are Session, Sandbox, Memory, Tool, Agent, Workflow, and Selector, with a v2.0.0 durable production layer (PostgreSQL/Redis/S3 data plane, Agent Server, effect ledger). Evidence is README documentation only; no code-inspected behavior is available. Evidence coverage: 161 of 218 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
